This product references the OWASP Top 10 for LLM Applications by category
name with attribution to the OWASP Foundation, and the NIST AI Risk
Management Framework 1.0 (a US Government work) by function and category
identifier. The "model card" section structure follows the publicly
described Model Cards reporting format by name only. See LEGAL.md.

The hash-chained audit log, run manifest, repo-hygiene controls, and drift
comparison modules are adapted from the author's sibling project Cybwaydb
(Apache-2.0, same copyright holder).
